"MsoNormal\\" align=\\"center\\" style=\\"text-align:center\\"><span style=\\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><img border=\\"0\\" width=\\"598\\" height=\\"398\\" style=\\"width:6.225in;height:4.15in\\" id=\\"_x0000_i1033\\" src=\\"https://email.topsolid.com/hs-fs/hubfs/0X4A4766_DESIGN_BOIS@stephanecouchet.jpg?width=1196&amp;upscale=true&amp;name=0X4A4766_DESIGN_BOIS@stephanecouchet.jpg\\" alt=\\"0X4A4766_DESIGN_BOIS@stephanecouchet\\"></span><span style=\\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:#EEEEEE\\"><span style=\\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#696976;display:none;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<table class=\\"MsoNormalTable\\" border=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" width=\\"100%\\" style=\\"width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"padding:7.5pt 15.0pt 7.5pt 15.0pt\\">\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" align=\\"center\\" style=\\"text-align:center;line-height:175%\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:175%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">La CFAO qui s’adapte à votre réalité métier</span></b><b><span style=\\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:175%;color:#1F305B;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><span style=\\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">Dans le bois, chaque projet est unique… mais vos contraintes, elles, sont constantes.</span></b><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><br>\\n</span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">Sur-mesure, délais serrés, exigences de qualité, coordination entre bureau d’études et atelier : tout doit s’enchaîner sans friction.\\n<b>Et pourtant, un simple décalage peut tout ralentir.</b></span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">Avec\\n<b>TopSolid’Wood</b>, changez de logique ! Vous ne subissez plus la complexité : vous la maîtrisez.</span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">Pensée pour les métiers du bois, la solution s’adapte à vos réalités terrain, du projet unitaire\\n à la production en série, tout en assurant la continuité numérique entre conception et fabrication.</span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">À la clé :\\n</span></b><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">des processus structurés, des données fiables et une production fluide, sans compromis sur votre savoir-faire.&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"line-height:150%\\"><b><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-fareast-language:FR\\">Reprenez le contrôle de vos projets bois, de la conception à l’usinage.</span></b><span style=\\"font-size:11.5pt;line-height:150%;color:#696976;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p class=\\"MsoNormal\\" style=\\"background:#EEEEEE\\"><span style=\\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#696976;display:none;mso-fareast-language:FR\\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\\n<table class=\\"MsoNormalTable\\" border=\\"0\\" cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" width=\\"100%\\" style=\\"width:100.0%;border-collapse:co