/div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\" dir=\\"ltr\\">\\nMerci&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\" dir=\\"ltr\\">\\nBonne journée&nbsp;</div>\\n<div id=\\"ms-outlook-mobile-body-separator-line\\" data-applydefaultfontstyles=\\"true\\" dir=\\"auto\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\" id=\\"ms-outlook-mobile-signature\\" dir=\\"auto\\">\\n<span style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Envoyé à partir de\\n</span><a href=\\"https://aka.ms/o0ukef\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">Outlook pour iOS</a></div>\\n<hr style=\\"display:inline-block;width:98%\\" tabindex=\\"-1\\">\\n<div id=\\"divRplyFwdMsg\\" dir=\\"ltr\\"><font face=\\"Calibri, sans-serif\\" style=\\"font-size:11pt\\" color=\\"#000000\\"><b>De :</b> MATHIEU DELVIGNE &lt;steelcreations@outlook.fr&gt;<br>\\n<b>Envoyé :</b> Tuesday, 29 September 2026 10:33:24<br>\\n<b>À :</b> Caufriez Valentin &lt;v.caufriez@ebanista.fr&gt;<br>\\n<b>Objet :</b> Re: DEVIS</font>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<div dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-system,Roboto,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nSalut,&nbsp;</div>\\n<div dir=\\"ltr\\" st