-date":"255","x-me-ip":"256","from":"257","content-type":"258","mime-version":"259","subject":"260","message-id":"261","references":"262","to":"263","date":"264","x-mailer":"265","x-spam-score":"266","x-spam-detail":"267","x-spam-verdict":"268","x-spam-state":"269","x-infomaniak-type":"270","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz1":"271","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz2":"272","x-infomaniak-pyzor-hash":"273","x-infomaniak-spam":"274","x-infomaniak-cause":"275","x-rspamd-server":"276","x-rspamd-queue-id":"277","x-spamd-result":"278","x-rspamd-action":"279"},"<html aria-label=\\"message body\\"><head><meta http-equiv=\\"content-type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\"></head><body style=\\"overflow-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; line-break: after-white-space;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Bonsoir Valentin,</span><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Je reviens vers vous car je n’ai pas eu de retour suite à mon mail du 30/09.</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Je suis en attente du devis corrigé (plan et tarification).</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">En ce qui concerne notre partie pour la libération de l’espace de travail tout est OK, vous pouvez intervenir dès maintenant quand</span><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">&nbsp;vous le souhaitez.</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Pour cela, avez-vous besoin d’un acompte ?</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Si oui de combien ?</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Je vous souhaite une bonne soirée et attend votre retour.</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Cordialement.</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">JM.MURY</span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\"><br id=\\"lineBreakAtBeginningOfMessage\\"></span><div><br><blockquote type=\\"cite\\"><div>Début du message réexpédié :</div><br class=\\"Apple-interchange-newline\\"><div style=\\"margin-