</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(200, 38, 19);\\">\\n<b>VENEZ DECOUVRIR ET TESTER TOUTES LES SOLUTIONS MILWAUKEE</b></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<b>Des remises exceptionnelles UNIQUEMENT lors de cette animation.</b></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<b>Vous n'êtes disponible qu'entre midi et 14h ? Venez, nous nous occupons du déjeuner</b> 🙂</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<i>Afin de prévoir les bonnes quantités, nous vous remercions de nous confirmer votre présence.</i></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nA bientôt</div>\\n<div id=\\"Signature\\" class=\\"elementToProof\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<b>Anasthasia HAOND</b></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<i>Chef des Ventes Sédentaire<br>\\nService Commercial<br>\\n</i>Tel: +33 (0)4 75 82 74 46<br>\\nPort: +33 (0)7 86 49 17 80<br>\\nFax: +33 (0)4 75 40 73 22<br>\\n<br>\\nPROLIANS RAA<br>\\nZI Les Auréats<br>\\n400 avenue Pierre Brossolette<br>\\n26800 PORTES-Lès-VALENCE</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nCréez votre espace en ligne sur Prolians.fr : <a href=\\"https://www.prolians.fr/customer/account/login/referer/?utm_medium=pdf&amp;utm_source=flyer&amp;utm_campaign=flyer-prolians-fr\\" id=\\"OWA698b09d8-7d5a-7be8-fcee-54089e77e967\\" class=\\"OWAAutoLink\\" title=\\"https://www.prolians.fr/customer/account/login/referer/?utm_medium=pdf&amp;utm_source=flyer&amp;utm_campaign=flyer-prolians-fr\\" style=\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\nProlians.fr</a></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; fo